HA = HD [08]

 * Auxiliary Constructions:
: Points


 * Proof steps:
001. AB ⟂ DA [01] & BC ⟂ AB [00] ⇒  DA ∥ BC [09]
002. BC ⟂ AB [00] & BC ∥ AD [09] & BC ⟂ DC [02] ⇒  ∠ABC = ∠ADC [10]
003. ∠ABC = ∠ADC [10] ⇒  B,D,C,A are concyclic [11]
004. B,D,C,A are concyclic [11] ⇒  ∠BDA = ∠BCA [12]
005. ED = EC [04] & GA = GB [06] ⇒  ED:EC = GA:GB [13]
006. AD ∥ BC [09] & E,D,C are collinear [03] & B,G,A are collinear [05] & ED:EC = GA:GB [13] ⇒  EG ∥ DA [14]
007. AD ∥ BC [09] & E,D,C are collinear [03] & B,G,A are collinear [05] & ED:EC = GA:GB [13] ⇒  EG ∥ CB [15]
008. E,D,C are collinear [03] & EC = ED [04] ⇒  E is midpoint of CD [16]
009. H,D,A are collinear [07] & HA = HD [08] ⇒  H is midpoint of AD [17]
010. E is midpoint of CD [16] & H is midpoint of AD [17] ⇒  EH ∥ CA [18]
011. B,G,A are collinear [05] & GA = GB [06] ⇒  G is midpoint of BA [19]
012. G is midpoint of BA [19] & H is midpoint of AD [17] ⇒  GH ∥ BD [20]
013. ∠BDA = ∠BCA [12] & EG ∥ AD [14] & EG ∥ BC [15] & AC ∥ EH [18] & BD ∥ GH [20] ⇒  ∠HEG = ∠EGH [21]
014. ∠HEG = ∠EGH [21] ⇒  HE = HG
